class Solution {
    public boolean isPowerOfThree(int n) {
        // Find the largest power of 3 that fits in an int
        int power = 3;
        while (power <= Integer.MAX_VALUE / 3) {
            power *= 3;
        }

        // n is a power of 3 iff it is positive and divides the largest power of 3
        return n > 0 && power % n == 0;
    }
}
```

This uses no loops over n and no recursion. The largest power of 3 in an `int` is divisible only by powers of 3, so checking divisibility by that value decides the answer in constant time.

